// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_L_Task2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MistressDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2067372717" "<color yellow>Only your task owner can interrogate the Mistress.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P3969244301" "I surrender. But answer me this. Why are you betraying us? Don't you realize what is at stake here?"
// Answer Text :
"P948254326" "Just tell me what the artifacts are for."
// Answer Text :
"P266124987" "Your life? (Start choking her)"
// Answer Text :
"P1466030660" "I'm not betraying anyone, my loyalty lies with the Emperor."
// Page Page1a Text :
"P2421697249" "The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall... With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good..."
// Answer Text :
"P3787631452" "You aren't telling me everything..."
// Answer Text :
"P3576482320" "Tell me everything, your life is at stake. (Begin choking her)"
// Answer Text :
"P2219064111" "And they will do great good in the hands of those loyal to the emperor."
// Page Page2a Text :
"P620062375" "...<br><br>Great evil can be done with them as well...<br><br>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// Answer Text :
"P1736797646" "You need not worry... they will be in good hands. (Kill her)"
// Page Page3a Text :
"P2028165291" "<color orange>The Mistress collapses dead at your feet.</color orange>"
// Answer Text :
"P2073291162" "As will you."
// Page Page1b Text :
"P1541317486" "P... Please... I... I'll... Tell... You... Everything... Ack..."
// Answer Text :
"P4012011302" "That's better... (Loosen your grip)"
// Page Page2b Text :
"P3594306941" "The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall... With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good.<br><br>But, great evil can be done with them as well...<br><br>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// Answer Text :
"P4036851998" "Shhh, you need not worry... (Kill her)"
// Answer Text :
"P1037921574" "Worrying is for the living."
// Page Page1c Text :
"P4191305328" "No! In the Emperor's hands these artifacts will kill hundreds! Thousands!"
// Answer Text :
"P201927689" "Well, if I don't know what they do I guess I should destroy them..."
// Page Page2c Text :
"P2774851918" "No!<br><br>Ok... Ok. Don't destroy them, I'll tell you.<br><br>The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall... With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good.<br><br>But, great evil can be done with them as well...<br><br>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// Answer Text :
"P3067391251" "The Shepherds? Why not?"
// Page Page3c Text :
"P1807742904" "Not all of the Shepherds are as harmless as they seem. Some proclaim they are agents of doom... But some actually are.<br><br>Do what you will with those artifacts, but if they end up in the hands of the Shepherds then death will come to us all."
// Answer Text :
"P3921266612" "I wouldn't worry about that... (Kill her)"
// Answer Text :
"P3868071184" "Death has already found you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1331099101" "D.U.S.T. has been given a green light to eliminate a Carnival of Light hideout in the Sunken City. This same group of Carnival mystics has been accumulating magical artifacts from the rubble of the destroyed city. My orders are to determine what exactly it is they are looking for so we can have a better idea of what the overall operations for the Carnival are in First Ward. You won't have a lot of time to get in and out before D.U.S.T. arrives. <color orange>Grab the evidence and get out before D.U.S.T. mucks everything up.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P480596605" "Seize evidence before D.U.S.T. destroys it"
// SendOffString :
"P2288140994" "The hideout is here and D.U.S.T. is already en route. <color orange>Interrogate the Carnival mistress leader and grab the evidence and then get out of there.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3749941537" "Seize evidence before D.U.S.T. ruins everything"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2676701424" "Get a move on. D.U.S.T. isn't known for their punctuality because you never know when they're going to pay you a visit."
// TaskTitle :
"P3980378157" "<font face=title><color orange>SEIZE CARNIVAL ARTIFACTS</color></font>"

