// Variable - Dialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DialogStartPage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1513414865" "I surrender.<t 2>But answer me this.<t 2>Why are you betraying us?<t 3>Don't you realize what is at stake here?"
// SaysList :
"P1612967211" "The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall...<t 4>With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good..."
// SaysList :
"P273478251" "...<t 2>Great evil can be done with them as well...<t 4>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// SaysList :
"P2854532399" "P...<t 1> Please...<t 1>I... I'll...<t 2> Tell...<t 1>You...<t 1>Everything...<t 2> Ack..."
// SaysList :
"P193459657" "The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall...<t 4>With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good.<t 4>But, great evil can be done with them as well...<t 4>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// SaysList :
"P3172133854" "No!<t 2>In the Emperor's hands these artifacts will kill hundreds! Thousands!"
// SaysList :
"P957429337" "No!<t 2>Ok... Ok.<t 2>Don't destroy them, I'll tell you.<t 3>The artifacts are all imbued with the death and sorrow of First Ward's fall...<t 4>With the right magic they could be utilized to do tremendous good.<t 4>But, great evil can be done with them as well...<t 4>Please, you must not let them fall into the hands of the Shepherds..."
// SaysList :
"P84164328" "Not all of the Shepherds are as harmless as they seem.<t 4>Some proclaim they are agents of doom... But some actually are.<t 4>Do what you will with those artifacts, but if they end up in the hands of the Shepherds then death will come to us all."

